  "contribution_rule": "Count an opportunity only when the candidate and its corresponding reference pass every fixed task behavior check before perturbation, the fixed positive-control sentinel makes at least one mapped task-consumer behavior check fail, and the same sentinel makes at least one mapped check fail for the candidate. A missing difference is unknown and earns no M; it is never generalized as proof of no reuse. Helper-only assertions, static imports, call counts, source compliance, and hashes do not establish contribution.",
